      "type": "reassess",
      "args": {},
      "justification": "Following initial stabilization and TBSA estimation, assess whether this patient meets American Burn Association criteria for transfer to a burn center (e.g., >10% TBSA, full-thickness burns, face/hands/genitalia involvement, inhalation injury)."
    },
    {
